" [1] My Issues │ [2] Team Issues │ [3] Analytics  "
"┌My Issues───────────────────────────────────────┐"
"│No open ┌ Keys ────────────────────────┐        │"
"│        │ Open & copy                  │        │"
"│        │  Enter  open the issue       │        │"
"│        │  yi/yu  copy key / URL       │        │"
"│        │  yb/ym  copy branch / link   │        │"
"│        │  o      Linear page or PR    │        │"
"│        │  O      other links          │        │"
"│        │                              │        │"
"│        │ App                          │        │"
"│        │  1/2/3  screens              │        │"
"│        │  r      refresh              │        │"
"│        │  ?,F1   keys                 │        │"
"│        │  :,C-k  palette              │        │"
"│        │  /      search               │        │"
"│        │  !      messages             │        │"
"│        │  Q      quit                 │        │"
"│        │  C-z    suspend              │        │"
"│        └ Esc close ───────────────────┘        │"
"└────────────────────────────────────────────────┘"
" Move │ j/k move                                  "
" Do   │ Enter pick  Tab toggle  Esc close         "
